Originally written by Vincent Goulet, 2026.

This directory contains files to build install-tl-iso-windows.exe, the
TeX Live ISO Installer Launcher for Windows.

TeX Live ISO Installer Launcher provides an installation wizard to
download the latest TeX Live ISO image, mount the image, and then
launch the TeX Live installer (at which point no Internet access is
needed). The wizard cleans up once the installation is complete.

Makefile			Recipes to build the InnoSetup script,
				the CTAN mirror list and the installer;
				see the header of the file.

install-tl-iso-windows.in	Input file for make to build the
				InnoSetup script.

start-installer.ps1		PowerShell script to start
				'install-tl-windows.bat' from the
				TeX Live ISO image. Only file included
				in the installer.
